19
00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.640
Think about it like this.

20
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.080
Safety stock scales with the standard deviation of your lead time, not just the average.

21
00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:21.080
So a fluctuating, unpredictable lane that randomly takes anywhere from 38 to 52 days,

22
00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:26.200
